factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the moderate rain with thunder is expected tomorrow (நாளை, Nov 27), but the draft says 'இன்று' (today) throughout the headline, reel script, slides and caption, so the date/timing is wrong.
  The draft says 'தேனி மாவட்டத்தின் மலைப்பகுதிகளில் இன்று ... கனமழை' (heavy rain today in Theni hill areas); the article attributes the heavy rain forecast to today, which is consistent, but the rest of the forecast for the 19 districts being 'today' contradicts the article's 'tomorrow'.
  The slides and caption state 'நாள்: இன்று (நவ. 27)' which places the 27 Nov forecast as today, while the article gives நாளை (நவ.27) i.e. tomorrow, meaning the forecast date is misstated.
  The reel_script omits that the 18 cm rainfall figure is for the 24 hours up to 'this morning' and the caption presents it as 'கடந்த 24 மணி நேரத்தில்' - this is acceptable, but the reel script's statement that the cause of the rain is the air-pressure trough is correct; however the slides also attribute 'நேற்றைய மழை' which the article does not state as yesterday.
  The slide 'புதுச்சேரியிலும் மழைக்கு வாய்ப்பு' under the Theni heading mixes two different areas (Theni hills with heavy rain and Puducherry with moderate rain) into one slide, and the reel_script's line 'புதுச்சேரியிலும் இதே நிலை இருக்கும்' wrongly implies the same condition (thunder with moderate rain) as the 19 districts, which is roughly consistent but the framing mixes distinct facts.
